{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:14OptiViewAdsSDK0abC6ConfigV15pdtGraceSecondsSdvp","title":"pdtGraceSeconds","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"}],"modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsSDK"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session is normally started before the content player has loaded its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source, so the scheduler’s first ticks see no PDT even on a stream that does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry it. Those ticks make no scheduling decision, rather than matching breaks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the system clock — which runs ahead of the live playhead by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream’s latency and would fire a break early (PLAYG-360)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"backstop, not a fixed delay","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The SDK stops waiting at whichever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comes first: content has been playing for ~1s and still exposes no PDT (direct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence about the stream — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DA-PDT-MISSING"},{"type":"text","text":" is emitted once and the clock"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes over immediately, so a join-in-progress break is not delayed below the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tune-in minimum), or this window elapses (the backstop for a player that never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" to fall back to the system clock immediately. Has no effect on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pts"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase manifests. Mirrors the web "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wallclock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk","abstract":[{"text":"The player-agnostic orchestration layer of the OptiView Ads SDK: the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAds","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" entry point,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its configuration, the public event stream and structured diagnostics.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"OptiViewAdsSDK","type":"topic"},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAdsConfig":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OptiViewAdsConfig","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OptiViewAdsConfig","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Org-level SDK configuration, fixed for the lifetime of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OptiViewAds"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OptiViewAdsConfig","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAdsConfig/pdtGraceSeconds":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"pdtGraceSeconds","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pdtGraceSeconds","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wallclock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}]},"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAd